{"seq":2,"slug":"lc0347-top-k-frequent-elements","title":"LeetCode 347 前 K 个高频元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-heap-monotonic/lc0347-top-k-frequent-elements","wordCount":905,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-347-前-k-个高频元素\">LeetCode 347 前 K 个高频元素</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个整数数组 <code>nums</code> 和一个整数 <code>k</code>，请你返回其中出现频率前 <code>k</code> 高的元素。你可以按任意顺序返回答案。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10^5</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^4 &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10^4</code></li>\n<li><code>k</code> 的取值范围是 <code>[1, 数组中不同元素的个数]</code></li>\n<li>题目数据保证答案唯一</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1,1,1,2,2,3], k = 2&#10;输出：[1,2]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1,1,1,2,2,3], k = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[1,2]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums = [1], k = 1&#10;输出：[1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums = [1], k = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[1]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>进阶要求：</strong> 你所设计算法的时间复杂度必须优于 O(n log n)，其中 n 是数组大小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题本质上是一个 Top-K 频率问题，首先需要统计每个元素的出现频率，然后从中选出频率最高的 <code>k</code> 个元素。</p>\n<p><strong>第一步：频率统计</strong></p>\n<p>无论选择哪种方法，都需要先用哈希表统计每个元素的出现次数，时间复杂度 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：桶排序</strong></p>\n<p>桶排序的核心思想是利用频率作为数组下标。创建一个长度为 <code>n + 1</code> 的桶数组，将频率为 <code>i</code> 的元素放入第 <code>i</code> 个桶中。然后从高频到低频遍历桶，收集前 <code>k</code> 个元素即可。</p>\n<p>这种方法巧妙地利用了频率的范围是有限的（最大为 <code>n</code>），将排序问题转化为线性遍历问题。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：小顶堆</strong></p>\n<p>维护一个大小为 <code>k</code> 的小顶堆，堆中存储的是 <code>[元素, 频率]</code> 对。遍历频率表，当堆大小小于 <code>k</code> 时直接入堆；当堆满且当前频率大于堆顶频率时，弹出堆顶并将当前元素入堆。</p>\n<p><strong>方法三：快速选择</strong></p>\n<p>将频率统计结果转化为数组后，使用快速选择算法找到频率第 <code>k</code> 大的元素，然后收集所有频率大于等于该值的元素。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>桶排序</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>最优时间，利用频率范围有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小顶堆</td>\n<td>O(n log k)</td>\n<td>O(n + k)</td>\n<td>适合数据流场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速选择</td>\n<td>平均 O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>平均最优但最差 O(n²)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序</td>\n<td>O(n log n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>最简单但不满足进阶要求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：桶排序（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function topKFrequent(nums: number[], k: number): number[] {&#10;  const freqMap = new Map&lt;number, number&gt;();&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    freqMap.set(num, (freqMap.get(num) ?? 0) + 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const buckets: number[][] = Array.from({ length: nums.length + 1 }, () =&gt; []);&#10;  for (const [num, freq] of freqMap) {&#10;    buckets[freq].push(num);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const result: number[] = [];&#10;  for (let i = buckets.length - 1; i &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; result.length &lt; k; i--) {&#10;    for (const num of buckets[i]) {&#10;      result.push(num);&#10;      if (result.length === k) break;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> topKFrequent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> freqMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    freqMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num, (freqMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> buckets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">num</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">freq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freqMap) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    buckets[freq].</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buckets.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buckets[i]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>方法二：小顶堆</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function topKFrequentHeap(nums: number[], k: number): number[] {&#10;  const freqMap = new Map&lt;number, number&gt;();&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    freqMap.set(num, (freqMap.get(num) ?? 0) + 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const heap: [number, number][] = [];&#10;&#10;  function siftUp(i: number): void {&#10;    while (i &gt; 0) {&#10;      const parent = (i - 1) &gt;&gt; 1;&#10;      if (heap[parent][1] &gt; heap[i][1]) {&#10;        [heap[parent], heap[i]] = [heap[i], heap[parent]];&#10;        i = parent;&#10;      } else break;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  function siftDown(i: number): void {&#10;    const n = heap.length;&#10;    while (2 * i + 1 &lt; n) {&#10;      let smallest = 2 * i + 1;&#10;      if (smallest + 1 &lt; n &amp;&amp; heap[smallest + 1][1] &lt; heap[smallest][1]) {&#10;        smallest++;&#10;      }&#10;      if (heap[i][1] &gt; heap[smallest][1]) {&#10;        [heap[i], heap[smallest]] = [heap[smallest], heap[i]];&#10;        i = smallest;&#10;      } else break;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (const [num, freq] of freqMap) {&#10;    if (heap.length &lt; k) {&#10;      heap.push([num, freq]);&#10;      siftUp(heap.length - 1);&#10;    } else if (freq &gt; heap[0][1]) {&#10;      heap[0] = [num, freq];&#10;      siftDown(0);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return heap.map(([num]) =&gt; num);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> topKFrequentHeap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-d